      <kw>TIME</kw>
    </keywords>
    <abstract>
      <p>This RFC specifies a standard for the ARPA Internet community.  Hosts on the ARPA Internet that choose to implement a Time Protocol are expected to adopt and implement this standard.  This protocol provides a site-independent, machine readable date and time.  The Time service sends back to the originating source the time in seconds since midnight on January first 1900.</p>
    </abstract>
